    <h2>Who can help</h2>
    <p>
      Most files are prepared with a local gestoria or law firm, a bank,
      and often an AGIA-registered estate agent for the housing
      certificate. We list only organisations with an official website.
    </p>
    <p>
      Start with
      <a href="/directory">the directory</a>:
      residency and tax counsel, the three Andorran banking groups,
      clinics, and licensed agents. For a company file, see
      <a href="/company-formation">company formation in Andorra</a>.
      For housing, see
      <a href="/buying-property">buying as a non-resident</a>,
      <a href="/properties">properties</a>
      and the
      <a href="/parishes">seven parishes</a>.
      Country notes:
      <a href="/moving-to-andorra-from-the-uk">UK</a>,
      <a href="/moving-to-andorra-from-spain">Spain</a>,
      <a href="/moving-to-andorra-from-france">France</a>.
    </p>
    <p>
      If you would like an introduction rather than a cold email, use the
      form. We are not a law firm and we do not file applications.
    </p>
  </section>

  <InterestForm
    intro="Leave an email if you want an introduction to residency counsel. We’ll write back."
